    "searchText": "finishing the job cleaning up someone else’s mess deadsaints_stanton_easy_recovercargo dead saints careercontract standing cargo pickup: nyx, stanton you know when you ask someone a question and you have a feeling they’re lying, but you choose to give them the benefit of the doubt? yeah. that’s what i’m dealing with right now.\n\ntwo “expert” haulers i hired to transport some gear for me ran into some trouble and ended up ditching my goods over at [location]. needless to say, i’ve ordered a hit on them, but what i need from you is to go recover that cargo. the tracker says the cargo’s still on the ship, so you’ll just need a a heavy-duty tractor beam and your own ship to recover it.\n\nyou might run into a couple of scavengers lurking around there, but i doubt you’ll have any trouble with them.\n\nwhen you’re done, take the stuff to [destination] and i’ll sort you out with a reward.\n\n-twitch lost but not gone retrieval op taking back our goods 2f95a69f-915e-4552-87fc-6e4f51785fe0 96bec6ad-249a-419d-a1e9-b283c9b2e39d d5208166-7993-44ff-825c-59309a6a88ec b2acdd21-9002-40a2-a736-6c20981711e6 889e49e3-3e9b-4d6f-b593-cc546c1e382b 82182227-797b-4bd6-978e-ee898cb8daec standing +100 credits formula unresolved standing +200 standing +50 standing +300 standing +150"
